      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have observed this as well. Although in my testing it seems like it kind of works, but not properly. Lots of jittering and inaccuracy in the mirror, only locally. Maybe it's different per constraint type, in my testing I was using Look At and Aim constraints.",
      "viewerReactions": null
