      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Oddly I've found some of my avatars work fine and others don't. I have an avatar with working rotation constraints on a dynamic bone, works fine in the mirror. I copied the project to make a version with different colors and the rotation constraints experience this issue on that one.",
